{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32089","headline":"黄鹄下太液池 · 贾岛","name":"黄鹄下太液池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高飞空外鹄，下向禁中池。\n岸印行踪浅，波摇立影危。\n来从千里岛，舞拂万年枝。\n踉跄孤风起，裴回水沫移。\n幽音清露滴，野性白云随。\n太液无弹射，灵禽翅不垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}